course: dictionary
lesson: 14129
title: Millionth, in order and in parts
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «Millionth» tells you the position of something in a line, like first or tenth. The millionth thing is the one that comes at number 1,000,000 when you count in order.
explain: It can also mean one part of something. If you cut a cake into a million equal pieces, one piece is a millionth. Look at the ending: million plus th, just like hundredth or twentieth.
explain: Context shows which meaning you need. «The shop gave a free bag to its millionth customer» means the one-millionth person. «I have told you for the millionth time» does not count anything. It means you have said it very many times.
fact: Millionth means coming at number 1,000,000 in order.
fact: A millionth is one part when something is divided into a million equal parts.
fact: One millionth can be written as a fraction, 1/1,000,000, or as a decimal, 0.000001.
fact: «The shop gave a free balloon to its millionth customer.» Shops and websites celebrate a millionth customer.
fact: «She had said sorry for the millionth time.» In everyday talk, this means very many times.
exercise: «The shop gave a free bag to its millionth customer.» What does millionth mean here? | One pound given back to the shop | Exactly one million customers in total | *Number one million in order | Ten thousand people in a queue
exercise: If you cut a cake into a million equal parts, what is one part called? | A hundredth | A half | *A millionth | A tenth
exercise: Which sentence uses millionth to mean very many times? | «The runner finished in tenth place.» | «The bus came at the fifth stop.» | *«I have told you for the millionth time to tidy your room.» | «We shared the cake into two parts.»
test: In «She was the millionth visitor to the museum», which number is she? | *1,000,000 | 1,000 | 10,000,000 | 100,000
test: What is one millionth written as a decimal? | *0.000001 | 0.01 | 0.1 | 0.0001
exam: Which word is the same kind of word as millionth, a number that shows position in order? | half | ten | *thirtieth | million
